      "bio": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko1.jpg\" alt=\"NEZUKO APIS Banner\" style=\"border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\" width=\"80%\">\n  \n  # ⚡ NEZUKO APIS OPEN API ⚡\n  **[ 3RAB TOP DEV ]**\n  \n  <br>\n  \n  [![Website](https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-monte--dev.online-ff69b4?style=for-the-badge&logo=google-chrome)](https://www.monte-dev.online/)\n  [![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Online-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge)](https://www.monte-dev.online/status)\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 About The Project\n**NEZUKO APIS** is a free, powerful, and blazing-fast Open API hub built for developers. We provide highly reliable endpoints to supercharge your applications, tools, and creative projects.\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Official Links & Directory\n\nExplore our ecosystem through the following links:\n\n* 🏠 **Home Page:** [www.monte-dev.online](https://www.monte-dev.online/)\n* 📜 **API Documentation:** [www.monte-dev.online/docs](https://www.monte-dev.online/docs)\n* 🟢 **Server Status:** [www.monte-dev.online/status](https://www.monte-dev.online/status)\n* ℹ️ **Site Info (JSON):** [www.monte-dev.online/api](https://www.monte-dev.online/api)\n* 📋 **Full API List (JSON):** [www.monte-dev.online/api/list](https://www.monte-dev.online/api/list)\n\n---\n\n## 📸 Gallery & Previews\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko2.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko3.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko4.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko5.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko6.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko7.jpg\" width=\"32%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko8.jpg\" width=\"48%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mzml-gg/nezuko-Photos/main/nezuko9.jpg\" width=\"48%\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## 👨‍💻 Developed By\n\nBuilt with passion by **3RAB_TOP_DEVS**\n\nSupport and follow our latest updates on social media:\n* 📺 **YouTube:** [@3rab_top_devs](https://www.youtube.com/@3rab_top_devs)\n* 📸 **Instagram:** [@3rab_top_devs](https://www.instagram.com/3rab_top_devs)\n",
